          // LDA $1600,X / ASL A / JSR C0/1CFC); `pfac` is the host's mirror of it and was still the
          // scene's spawn default (1 = down) after a seed whose $1600 said up -- the probe then looked
          // the wrong way and no seeded talk fixture could ever open a box (scene 7's obj13, 2026-09-03).
